window.products.push({"id":1005117,"name":"Enesco Trail of Painted Ponies Wild Blue Remembering 9/11 Figurine, 9.5 in H x 3.75 in W x 8.25 in L, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YfkohjafL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Trail of Painted Ponies celebrates the magic of the horse as an artistic canvas, the rich culture of America, and the unique talents of independent artists. The artists behind this exquisite collection come from all different backgrounds, and the inspirational stories behind each design are as heartfelt as they are beautiful. There have been a number of powerful tributes to the tragedy of 9/11, among them the commemorative public art installation known as the Tribute of Lights: a pair of giant beams of light, installed at Ground Zero, that mimicked the position and shape of the Twin Towers of the World Trade Center as they illuminated the night sky over Manhattan. With this image in mind, I conceived of a Painted Pony that utilized the same form that The Trail created for a previous tribute to 9/11 titled \"Unconquered,\" which posed a white stallion triumphantly atop rubble intended to represent the collapsed Twin Towers, with an American flag behind it. But instead of a white horse, this piece would feature a faceted blue horse. Blue because the lights in the Tribute of Lights were blue. Faceted to represent the 43,600 windows that were part of the Twin Towers, as well as the venues on the top floors of the North Tower which were called Windows on the World. The title - \"Wild Blue\" - borrows the name of a restaurant in the North Tower that was destroyed. About Us: Enesco is committed to BRING JOY EVERY DAY. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, and home decor, our prestigious family of brands includes: Department 56 Village, Things Remembered, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore, Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Designs by Lolita, Our Name Is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YfkohjafL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enesco","source_asin":"B08V94321F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1005117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V94321F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V94321F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1005118,"name":"The Royal Gift Shop: Red Rust Genuine Brazilian Extra Quality Agate Bookends - Home Decor (Red Rust, 2-3 lbs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818R1Wu+JNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BRAZILIAN AGATE GEODES are sliced and polished to create natural bookends that show off the beauty of both the rough and polished stone. These bookends have two polished sides for each piece and a smooth cut base. Agate is excellent for balancing emotional and physical energy. Historically, it has been used in healing amulets and ornamentation dating back to Babylon. 'Agate' is the name given to numerous varieties of banded Chalcedony, a mineral of the quartz family. Usually banded in layers or stripes, some varieties have specks of color or fossilized inclusions, while others are solid. Dubbed a 'earth rainbow', the concentric bands of Agate form in nearly every color the earth can produce, including a colorless shade. SOME WIDELY ACCLAIMED BENEFITS OF AGATE: Promotes inner stability, composure, and maturity  Its warm, protective properties encourage security and self-confidence It is a great crystal to use during pregnancy, and also helps new mothers avoid the 'baby Blues' sometimes experienced after giving birth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818R1Wu+JNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Royal Gift Shop","source_asin":"B01I46U6UU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1005118","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I46U6UU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I46U6UU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
