window.products.push({"id":1005440,"name":"Meiyou Cordless-Handheld Vacuum-Portable Car-Rechargeable-Lightweight - 9KPa Cyclonic Powerful Suction with Stainless Steel HEPA Filter for Home/Pet H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612ot1nzrKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WIRELESS PORTABLE VACUUM Portable vacuum cleaner 👍 Powerful high power handheld wet dry cleaning kit with CE certificate. Turn on the handheld vacuum cleaner and wipe away dirt quickly and easily. 👍 Powerful and portable Helps keep your car clean. There are several accessories that help you clean small corners that are difficult to clean. Provide a convenient carry bag that makes it easy to store your car vacuum under a seat, in the trunk, or in the glove compartment. 👉 DUST BRUSH 👈inhales as much as gravel and dust  👉 CROSSED NOZZLE 👈 clean a hard-to-reach spot, like the seat space 👉 EXTENSION HOSE 👈clean a hard-to-reach spot, like under a seat Instruction 1. Insert one end of the charger into the rear of the vacuum. 2. Plug the charger into a 120V outlet. 3. The flashing light indicates that the power plug is properly connected to the charger and is charging. 4. The dust cup should be emptied after each use, and the vacuum cleaner should be separated from the charger when cleaning. 5. Clean the dust cup and filter with water and allow them to dry. Precautions 1. Fully charge the vacuum when you receive the vacuum. Charge fully until the green light comes on. 2. The vacuum cleaner can only be charged from a 120V power supply using a company exclusive charger. 3. The vacuum cleaner cannot work steadily for a long time. Generally, pause 1 to 2 minutes after 10 to 12 minutes of operation to protect the electric motor. 4. Clean the filter net in time so as not to affect the dust collection efficiency. 5. The filter net can be washed. Air dry after washing. 6. When the battery runs out, please charge the vacuum cleaner after turning off the power, otherwise it cannot be charged.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612ot1nzrKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meiyou","source_asin":"B09GXFDQ1W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1005440","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GXFDQ1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GXFDQ1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
