window.products.push({"id":1005683,"name":"nambe Curvo All-Purpose Tongs | Stainless Steel Kitchen Tongs for Cooking, Grilling, and Barbeque | 13 Inch | Dishwasher Safe | Designed by Steve Cozz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yr0ujh0fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIMPLY YET STYLISH: The Curvo All-Purpose Tongs bring style and functional simplicity to mealtime. Polished to a mirror finish inside and out for beautiful shine. They’re sleek and simple to pair perfectly with any of you existing kitchen décor and serveware, while still providing a little touch of elegance for your meal. ELEGANT AND EFFICIENT: These gently scooped tongs have just a hint of teeth at the end. They’re useful for everything from pasta to mussels to stir-frying. The oval shapes add a welcome bit of traction, so you don’t have to worry about losing any of your delicious food with each grab. STEVE COZZOLINO CREATION: Based in New York City, the focus of Cozzolino Studio is the fusion of art and science-the synergy of form and function, poetry and technology, appearance and performance. To coalesce beauty with technology, to achieve a sensibility and innovation that is empathetic to the consumer and, above all, elevates our lives daily. MUSEUM QUALITY DESIGN: Recognized for its award-winning designs for more than 60 years, Nambe’s commitment to timeless beauty, artistic integrity and uncompromising quality is evident in the brand’s collection of serve ware, barware, home décor and gift items. Nambe collaborates with the world’s most esteemed designers to develop products that bring function and style into the home. PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS: Package contains (1) Nambe Curvo All-Purpose Tongs. Modern décor style. Made with stainless steel. Measures 13-Inches H x 1.5-Inches W. Dishwasher safe. Design by Steve Cozzolino in 2012 as a part of the Gourmet collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yr0ujh0fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nambe","source_asin":"B00DWD2AAU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1005683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DWD2AAU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DWD2AAU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
