window.products.push({"id":1005701,"name":"Swissmar Borner V Power Mandoline (Orange)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":61.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FR4nahjgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It all started in 1956 when Alfred Borner, a toolmaker by profession, started the business manufacturing an onion cutter. This cutter was made of wood with four razor-sharp blades bent in such a way to make cutting onions into cubes easy work. This one invention sparked many more, and product demand increased worldwide. Borner has become a well established company over the last 50 years, producing state of the art kitchen tools in Germany. They manufacture the finest quality vegetable slicers and mandolins on the market today and are leaders in design and technology. From the V-Slicer Plus to the new V-Power line, Borner products help add creativity to any gourmet meal. V-Power is the newest addition to the Borner family and is made of durable ABS plastic with German surgical grade stainless steel blades. Three inserts offer ten different cuts, the V-Power can cube, julienne, slice and shred. A patented push button adjustment allows you to change the size/thickness of the cut without removing the insert; the plane insert has a safety position to completely cover the V-blade when not in use. The ambidextrous Food Safety Holder has a serrated edge to safely push food off slicer, requires very little pressure and with a quick 90-degree rotation, can produce a variety of different cuts. Steel pins grip most sizes and shapes of produce to create even slices every time. An insert holder provides protective storage for extra inserts; acts as a drying stand and attaches to back of unit for compact storage. Easy to clean; rinse under hot or cold running water immediately after use","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FR4nahjgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swissmar","source_asin":"B003CN6Q5K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1005701","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003CN6Q5K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003CN6Q5K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1005702,"name":"Lipper International Bamboo Wood In-Drawer Knife Organizer, 18\" x 5-3/4\" x 2-1/4\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xa0Zo2pTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lipper International provides exceptionally valued items for the kitchen, home, office, and child's playroom. Known for their functionality and beauty, each of our products is individually crafted from the finest quality materials. Safely store your prized knives with this In-Drawer Knife Block/Organizer. Hand wash with a mild soap and cool water. Do not soak. Do not put in the dishwasher, microwave or refrigerator. Extreme changes in temperature will cause the material to crack over time. Dry thoroughly. Occasional use of mineral oil on the inside will help maintain its appearance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xa0Zo2pTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lipper International","source_asin":"B01DF3DAPU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1005702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DF3DAPU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DF3DAPU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1005703,"name":"Honeywell Household Odor & Gas Reducing Pre-Filter, 2 Pack, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.05,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gQ3DV-p6L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This Honeywell Air Purifier K Pre-Filter helps capture larger particles such as dust, lint, fibers and pet fur, while helping to absorb some common household VOC gases and fumes.* The Honeywell Replacement Pre-Filter K fits Honeywell Air Purifier models: HDF300 series, HDF310/320/360 series, HFD280 series, HFD-120/140, HD123 series, and HFD230 series. Cutting template is included for QuietClean and Compact AirGenius. This package contains 2 pre-filters that should be replaced every 3 months for best performance Always purchase Genuine Honeywell replacement air purifier filters and pre-filters. They are certified to help capture odors and the following microscopic allergens and particles: dust, pollen, pet dander, dust mite debris, and smoke.* Other compatible filter replacements are not guaranteed to offer the same performance or efficiency. Disclaimers: * From the air that passes through the filter, 0.3 microns and larger. ** Based on 3rd party independent CADR testing for the smoke CADR value when operated at the highest level. Air circulation depends on many factors, such as room size and configuration. There is no guarantee that all of the air in a room will pass through the filter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gQ3DV-p6L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honeywell","source_asin":"B007TASC04","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1005703","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007TASC04","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007TASC04","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
