window.products.push({"id":1005723,"name":"POLY & BARK Office Chair, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ibrcxcLAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Not all too often does a chair come along that fits well in most modern offices. While there are thousands to choose from, the Ribbed Mid Back Office Chair consistently stands out from among the rest. More than just a contemporary piece, the chair delivers a clear and compelling message. The design is about the achievement of form and the pristine possibilities of human endeavor. Superior to all the bells and whistles in the world, is the ability to transform a chair into an art form. The Ribbed Mid Back Office Chair also has all the amenities you expect. From the durable back that keeps your posture, to the padded seat that eases pressure on your thighs, great thought has gone into all aspects of the design. The chair is fully height adjustable with a 360 degree swivel and five caster hooded base. Known for its attention-grabbing sheen, the frame is constructed from highly polished and durable chrome-plated steel. The 5 star base and armrests are made of a highly durable cast aluminum. The chair also comes with a tension knob and tilt lever for leaning back and forth as desired. There is also a tilt lock mechanism to keep your position in place. The Ribbed Mid Back Office Chair frequently graces the stage of movie sets, news agencies and Fortune 500 offices. If you have started your search looking for a \"modern office chair,\" this is probably the one your friends would tell you to get.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ibrcxcLAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POLY & BARK","source_asin":"B01GFNIQOW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1005723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GFNIQOW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GFNIQOW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1005724,"name":"Americaware - City of New Orleans Souvenir Ceramic Coffee Mug/Cup - 18oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.86,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VDS3PA01L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Did you love your trip to New Orleans?  This mug will be your favorite reminder. The vibrant images of famous landmarks and scenes from around New Orleans are cherished memories.  The mugs are generously sized and great for coffee, tea or a special soup.   Souvenir cups are great gifts for friends or family who love New Orleans.  Dishwasher and Microwave safe.  They are Lead free and prop 65 compliant.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VDS3PA01L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Americaware Inc.","source_asin":"B07G8N789N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1005724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G8N789N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G8N789N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
