window.products.push({"id":1005836,"name":"NOVICA Hand Painted Wooden Alebrije Hanging Holiday Tree Frog Ornaments, Set of 5, Colorful Frogs'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JgHKQTARL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA works together with talented artists, artisans, and designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake handmade treasures. Our mantra is to Spread Happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer!About this item: Perfect as home decor or for hanging on the tree, five little frogs are crafted of copal wood, painted by hand with vibrant, colorful designs. Mexico's Claudio Ojeda designs this set of ornaments, carrying on the tradition of Guanajuato alebrije sculpture.Hand-crafted item -- color, size and/or motif may vary slightlyMarked with artist's initials or trademarkAbout our Artist: 'I'm Claudio Ojeda and I was born in Oaxaca. My parents are also artists in the tradition of the Mazatec and Zapotec peoples. When I was six, my mother began teaching me to make 'alebrijes',' which are small and fanciful figurines whose form is dictated by natural twigs and branches. My sculptures are crafted in the same way as traditional alebrijes, but I felt I had to do something different. I think bulls are admirable and emblematic. They symbolize power, honor and strength, and I began making alebrijes in their likeness. I want to demonstrate the principles my mother taught me through my crafts, which are loyalty, honor, respect for the family and love for my work. I think that every day is a struggle and, in that struggle, alebrijes are our guardians.'...","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JgHKQTARL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B07HFHWWGT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1005836","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HFHWWGT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HFHWWGT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
