window.products.push({"id":1005860,"name":"Handcrafted Wooden Sign - Rank Of Poker Hands","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lBY0pqCJL._AC_.jpg","description":"There's no substitute for woodwork crafted by skilled hands! Your hand made \"Rank of Poker Hands\" sign beautifully reveals the rank of each poker hand and suit Spades - Hearts - Diamond - Clubs. This sign is wonderful sign to have in your card room. Do you like tradition? \"Rank of Poker Hands\" is fashioned in red and gold drop shadow calligraphy on a navy blue background. The ranks are lettered in a flat white serif font. These colors really pop. The color scheme is bold and the alignment is well structured. The design is simple, but the variation in fonts and colors enhances this sign's visual appeal. The piece is finished with a routed edge and a thin gold pin stripe painted onto both angles of the bevel. Concerned about the size or weight? \"Rank of Poker Hands\" measures 11 x 13.5 and is deceptively light for its size. It weighs 3 lbs. The back of your sign features an engraved key hole to simplify hanging and leveling. Want to give a memorable gift ... a gift that will last a lifetime? Want to conclude the uncertainty of which hand is best? \"Rank of Poker Hands\" makes a friendly statement and it's suitable for any home, office, or game room / casino. Please buy yours today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lBY0pqCJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poker Theme | Game Room Man Cave Office","source_asin":"B005KU8WU0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1005860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005KU8WU0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005KU8WU0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
