window.products.push({"id":1005949,"name":"GorillaRock Bubble Waffle Maker Electric Non Stick Egg waffle machine 360 Rotated Stainless steel (110V)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":104.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bkfbdEzsL._AC_.jpg","description":"✪ COMMERCIAL USE: This electric waffle iron with a stylish black front panel makes one big hexagon-shaped Bubble Waffle, also known as Egg Waffle or Hong Kong Waffle. The machine is equipped with a mechanical control system. The power is 1.4kW. The appliance is featured a rotating system that allows distributing the dough uniformly and baking each waffle from both sides by flipping the plates. It takes a few minutes to cook a nutritive waffle 7\" x 8\" ✪ HIGH QUALITY: This Bubble Waffle maker is produced of 201 Stainless steel that ensures the long service life of the appliance. Stainless steel is known for its rust resistance and durability, which is important for professional kitchen equipment. Long wooden handles don’t get hot, so the usage is safe, and the risk of accidental burns is minimized. The machine requires a minimum of effort to clean and maintain. ✪ SIMPLE OPERATIONS: There is no particular training needed to start using this mechanical Bubble Waffle maker right away. All the operations are simple and comprehensible. Start the machine with an on/off switch on the front panel, adjust the desired heat level with a temperature knob, and set the cooking time with a timer. A big golden-brown crunchy Egg waffle will be ready to serve in a few minutes. ✪ NONSTICK COATING: The baking plates are made of cast aluminum with a nonstick top. The nonstick coating prevents the dough from sticking and burning. The plates are highly conductive and get warm fast and evenly, providing uniform heating. As a result, bubble waffles obtain a beautiful golden-brown color that makes them look so appetizing! To keep the plate clean, just wipe it with a damp rag after use. ✪ 100% GUARANTEED QUALITY: Great customer support with a flexible return policy and a money-back guarantee. Your satisfaction is our main priority, that is why we are constantly improving our service and value any feedback. We are always available for any questions and concerns you might have. We provide warranty and after-sale service support to make sure you are fully satisfied with your experience and our product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bkfbdEzsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GorillaRock","source_asin":"B08CR9W2Y4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1005949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CR9W2Y4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CR9W2Y4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
