window.products.push({"id":1005964,"name":"Tommy Bahama Big Boy 4-Position Folding 13\" High Seat Backpack Beach or Camping Chair, Aluminum, Navy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":92.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kVuK1EkBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Travel hands-free with the Tommy Bahama 4-Position Big Boy Backpack Beach Chair. The adjustable, backpack shoulder straps allow for unrestricted movement and custom-fitability so you can travel in comfort. The lightweight, rust-proof, heavy duty beach frame weighs only 11 lbs. The portable folding beach chair is compact and easy to carry. Most beach chairs sit 8 inches off the ground. The Big Boy beach chair provides a higher seating option at 13 inches off the ground and features an extra-wide seat and backrest to support larger body types. This chair provides all day comfort. Enjoy outdoor camping, concerts at the park or use as a sports chair on the sideline. It’s perfect for the beach but versatile for all outdoor activities or sports. The large storage pouch has plenty of room to carry your beach or camping accessories plus a beach towel. Secure items inside the bag with the Velcro closure. Features include wider, molded armrests that provide comfort to elbows and forearms and a 4-position easy SAFE-ADJUST recline. Adjust to the desired position without the worry of getting your fingers or hands caught in the brackets. The reclining chair, molded armrest, and extra wide seating makes this a heavy duty beach chair that supports up to 300 lbs. The outdoor backpack chair includes an adjustable, removable contoured pillow that softly supports your neck and a convenient seat-side cup holder to secure your favorite beverage. The folding compact design of the Tommy Bahama backpack beach chairs are made from high quality aluminum and features a locking bracket to prevent the beach chair from tilting or folding while in use. The locking bracket also reinforces the wider seat frame for a stronger, more durable, chair. Make life one long weekend with the Tommy Bahama Big Boy Backpack Beach Chair. SEAT HEIGHT: 13 inches SEAT WIDTH: 22 inches CHAIR WEIGHT: 11 lbs WEIGHT CAPACITY: 300 lbs OPEN DIMENSIONS: 35” x 28 x 24” CLOSED DIMENSIONS: 31.5” x 28” x 4.5\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kVuK1EkBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tommy Bahama","source_asin":"B07VKHL41X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1005964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VKHL41X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VKHL41X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1005965,"name":"Churchill China Chelsea Blue Willow 5-Piece Dinnerware Completer Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YC53QQHML._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description To complement each Willow starter set we offer this 5 piece completer set which has the matching Serving platter, Open Bowl & of course the Cream Jug along with a Covered Sugar Bowl. Amazon.com Each member of this 5-piece Chelsea Blue Willow completer set features the patterns romantic imagery in a classic dark blue and white palette. Based on a legend of two star-crossed Chinese lovers, the pieces have intricately detailed double borders. Within, a depiction of a Chinese landscape includes a river, houses, trees, and boats. Above the scene, two hovering doves represent reincarnations of the fugitive lovers. This serving set features an oval platter, an open vegetable bowl, a creamer, a sugar bowl, and a sugar bowl lid. Each piece is made from high-fired earthenware with a chip-resistant glossy glaze over the transfer-printed pattern. Designed to withstand frequent use, Chelsea Blue Willow is safe in the microwave, freezer, and dishwasher. --Emily Bedard Whats in the Box 5 service pieces: 12-1/4-by-9-1/2-inch oval platter; 9-1/2-inch round open bowl; 9-ounce creamer; 8-ounce sugar bowl; sugar bowl lid.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YC53QQHML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Churchill China","source_asin":"B0000C0V58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1005965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000C0V58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000C0V58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1005966,"name":"RunningBear Custom Pink Cow Milk Water Bottle with Straw Lid Personalized 33oz Insulated Sports Water Bottle Customized Stainless Steel Water Jugs for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514N7qc-5yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Choose Personalized Sports Water Bottle?  1) High Quality Materials -- Made of food-grade 304 stainless steel, BPA free, equipped with polyethylene straws, food-grade silicone, safe and non-toxic, resistant to high temperature and not deformed. 2) Premium Insulation: --The outer wall of the food-grade stainless steel inner tank is attached with an insulating layer, which enhance the cold and heat preservation effect. -- Eg: Keep drink cold for up to 24 hours; 100 ℃ hot water, put it at about 45 ℃ for 10 hours, and about 65 ℃ for 6 hours. 3) Design: -- Two sizes: 600ml(20oz) and 1000ml(33oz), fit in most of holders, backpack pockets. -- Cute patterns printed and your NAME on the outer of the bottle. -- The handle of the kettle is widened, which can be easily carry with two fingers, making it more portable. -- The bottle cap is equipped with a vent valve to ensure air circulation. -- The bottle cap and the straw is combined, which can be folded and stored to ensure clean and hygienic.  4)Perfect Gift: -- Fitness, cycling, hiking, camping or just just for hydration, this bottle will be an awesome gift for yourselves, friends and families!  5) Instructions: -- Wash the bottle with neutral detergent + warm water before use. -- It is recommended to add hot water or ice cubes for preheating or precooling. -- Please tighten the lid clockwise to prevent leakage. 6)Notes: -- Do not add dry ice, carbonated drinks, liquids containing alkaline and acidic ingredients. -- Do not soak in water for a long time (≤30 mins). When the printing position is blistered due to soaking in water, do not rub it with your hands to make the printing fall off. After the foaming, let the bottle dry naturally. The position will return to its original state. --If you have any questions about the item, please contact us by email, we will reply you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514N7qc-5yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RunningBear","source_asin":"B0B5R2V2P6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1005966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5R2V2P6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5R2V2P6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
